<title>THAILAND: Securities One sells unit for $65.65 mln.</title>
<headline>Securities One sells unit for $65.65 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai brokerage Securities One Plc said on Friday it was selling off it unit Asia Equity Holding for $65.65 million to France's Banque Paribas.</p>
<p>Asia Equity Holding is Securities One's regional brokerage and research arm that was acquired by the firm previously from First Asia Equity Plc.  </p>
<p>Securities One merged with First Asia Securities through a share swap deal early this year.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
